      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grants_Pass%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Indigenous Takelma and other tribes have lived in the Rogue and Illinois Valleys since time immemorial, and their descendants still celebrate traditions today.",
